sequenceDiagram
    participant Sensor as Accelerometer
    participant VM as SensorViewModel
    participant ML as TFLite pipeline
    participant Room as Room DB
    participant Act as Actuator
    participant Outbox as Durable outbox
    participant Cloud as Firebase
    Sensor->>VM: x y z timestamp
    VM->>Room: sampled movement record
    VM->>ML: sample
    ML->>ML: circular buffer and inference
    ML-->>Act: ACTIVE confidence at least 0.75
    Act->>Act: vibration pulse
    Act->>Room: typed actuator event
    VM->>Outbox: stable upload operation
    alt network available
        Outbox->>Cloud: owner scoped write
        Cloud-->>Outbox: acknowledge FIFO head
    else offline
        Outbox->>Outbox: retain pending operation
        Outbox->>Cloud: WorkManager retry after reconnect
    end
